  "dmNarration": [
    "After the hideout raid, the party recovered Gundren and brought him to the inn. In this mock he wakes after the brief Sleep effect ends. He can explain the route to Wave Echo Cave; possession of a map is not the only way onward. Glasstaff escaped, and no one observed his destination. A rat left behind remains available to capture, leave or investigate.",
    "Qelline introduced Reidoth as a guide who knows the wood. He welcomes a respectful approach and can describe the route to Cragmaw Castle without demanding that you kill a dragon. Captured Redbrand testimony says the gang worked with that stronghold, but does not prove where the fugitive went. Sildar hopes to recover his stolen gear there.",
    "The castle is an optional expedition before the mine. You can scout the ruined gate, find a different entrance, negotiate, withdraw or head directly to the mine. No prisoner or stolen item is automatically in any particular room. At the tower village, Reidoth warns you to avoid a dangerous dragon rather than requiring a fight."
  ],
  "question": "Choose whether to visit the castle or go directly to the mine, a castle approach if chosen, what to do with the rat, and one action from your phone. Inspect the new guided flow, current objectives, sheets, resources, map/fog and item custody. Keep private information private.",
